    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "25. Muster Armies",
    "ruleNumber": "25.04",
    "summary": "Apply the battle-size limits and the roster restrictions of the chosen units and detachments. Buy distinct faction detachments with DP. Incursion normally allows 2 DP, with an exception for a single 3 DP detachment. Choose faction-eligible units and record sizes, equipment, upgrades and points. Name a CHARACTER in a CHARACTER unit with your faction keyword as WARLORD. Datasheet mandates constrain that choice, and a prohibition overrides a mandate. Assign Leaders and Supports to compatible Bodyguards under 19.01. Every Support needs an assignment. Buy Enhancements from selected detachments and add their cost to the recipients. By default, a qualifying CHARACTER model receives each Enhancement and EPIC HEROES are excluded. Each unit, including an attached unit, has one slot. Ordinary Enhancements are unique. Upgrade Enhancements can go to non-CHARACTER units and have a three-copy maximum. Copies two and three still cost points and use no additional army-wide Enhancement allowance.",
